entation\/swami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityAction(named:_:)-6oc0o":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityAction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"accessibilityAction(named:_:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/acces